[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SILENCE]
Silence Decree

[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SILENCE_desc]
Force the entire Crystal Empire into a state of complete silence, during which military effectiveness and internal stability will be greatly increased, but production will be affected and new focuses cannot be pursued.

[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SILENCE_START_TOOLTIP]
Start the §YSilence Decree§! Cannot proceed national focuses during the §YSilence Decree§!.

[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SILENCE_END_TOOLTIP]
End the §YSilence Decree§!.

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SILENCE]
噤声令

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SILENCE_desc]
强制整个水晶帝国进入完全静默状态，在此期间军队战斗能力和国内稳定度将会大幅提高，但生产会受到影响，也不能推动新的国策。

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SILENCE_START_TOOLTIP]
开始§Y噤声令§!。§Y噤声令§!持续期间无法推进国策。

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SILENCE_END_TOOLTIP]
结束§Y噤声令§!。
